        "latex": "M_{R}\\left(c\\right)\\coloneq\\mathrm{sum}\\left(\\sigma_{c}\\left(\\varepsilon\\left(c,x_{c}\\right)\\right)A_{c}x_{c}\\right)+A_{b1}\\mathrm{sum}\\left(\\sigma_{b}\\left(\\varepsilon\\left(c,p_{l1}\\right)\\right)p_{l1}\\right)+\\delta_{2}A_{b2}\\mathrm{sum}\\left(\\sigma_{b}\\left(\\varepsilon\\left(c,p_{l2}\\right)\\right)p_{l2}\\right)",
