        "html": "7. SHEAR CHECK (EN 1992-1-1:2023 §8.2.3, SPIRALS)",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 9968,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "7.1 Chords, web width and stresses",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#334155",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10008,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Truss in stresses: τEd = VEd/(bw·z) (8.18); spirals τRd,sy = ρw·fywd·cotθ (8.42); strut",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10038,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "σcd = τEd·(cotθ + tanθ) ≤ ν·fcd (8.44), ν = 0.5 (8.2.3(6)). bw: least width between the",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6k",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10068,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "compression chord (centroid of the concrete compression at the bending resistance under NEd)",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10098,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "and the tension chord (depth d). Each spiral crosses the shear plane twice: Asw = 2·Aw.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 10142,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Effective depth: D/2 + half-ring centroid 2r/π, weighted by bar area",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_col_6n",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 10168,
      "props": {
        "w": 60,
        "h": 32,
        "latex": "d\\coloneq\\frac{D}{2}+\\frac{2}{\\pi}\\cdot\\frac{n_{l1}A_{b1}r_{1}+\\delta_{2}n_{l2}A_{b2}r_{2}}{n_{l1}A_{b1}+\\delta_{2}n_{l2}A_{b2}}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
